          "short": "$Q_1=64$, median $=76$, $Q_3=82$, IQR $=18$.",
          "worked": "There are 30 values. The median is the average of the 15th and 16th values. Each half contains 15 values, so its median is its 8th value: the 8th and 23rd values overall.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Median}&=\\frac{75+77}{2}\\\\\\text{Median}&=76\\\\Q_1&=64\\\\Q_3&=82\\\\\\text{IQR}&=82-64\\\\\\text{IQR}&=18\\end{align*}$$",
